
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Kuroneko Archive</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DotGothic16&family=Nunito:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 25px 15px;
      background: #e9dfe0;
      color: #44363c;
      font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif;
      background-image: radial-gradient(#cdbfc2 0.7px, transparent 0.7px);
      background-size: 12px 12px;
    }

    .site {
      max-width: 760px;
      margin: auto;
      background: #fffaf5;
      border: 2px solid #493d42;
      box-shadow: 7px 7px 0 #a58f96;
    }

    header {
      background: #f4cbd0;
      padding: 25px;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #493d42;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .pixel {
      font-family: 'DotGothic16', sans-serif;
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 3px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-family: 'DotGothic16', sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(27px, 7vw, 43px);
      margin: 18px 0 8px;
    }

    .intro { font-size: 13px; }

    nav {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 9px;
      padding: 15px;
      border-bottom: 2px dashed #cdb9bd;
    }

    nav a {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #493d42;
      border: 1px solid #493d42;
      padding: 7px 13px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      background: white;
    }

    nav a:hover {
      background: #f4cbd0;
    }

    main { padding: 25px; }

    .notice {
      background: #f9edef;
      border: 1px dashed #c28d9a;
      padding: 15px;
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    h2 {
      font-family: 'DotGothic16', sans-serif;
      font-size: 19px;
      margin-top: 30px;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #493d42;
      padding-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .work {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 15px 5px;
      border-bottom: 1px dashed #cdb9bd;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .work a {
      color: #a65e73;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .tag {
      background: #f4dce0;
      padding: 4px 8px;
      font-size: 10px;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    footer {
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
      background: #f4cbd0;
      border-top: 2px solid #493d42;
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    @media(max-width: 450px) {
      main { padding: 18px; }
      .work { font-size: 11px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="site">

  <header>
    <div class="pixel">✳ WELCOME TO MY LITTLE WORLD ✳</div>
    <h1>kuroneko archive</h1>
    <div class="intro">
      a little corner for stories, memories & imagination.
    </div>
    <p> ฅ^•ﻌ•^ฅ </p>
  </header>

  <nav>
    <a href="#home">HOME</a>
    <a href="#masterlist">MASTERLIST</a>
    <a href="#about">ABOUT</a>
    <a href="#links">LINKS</a>
  </nav>

  <main>
    <section id="home">
      <div class="notice">
        <b>✉ HELLO, INTERNET STRANGER!</b><br>
        Welcome to my personal archive.
        Take your time and explore my little collection
        of fictional worlds.
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="masterlist">
      <h2>♡ MASTERLIST</h2>

      <div class="work">
        <a href="#">01. your story title ↗</a>
        <span class="tag">LONG AU</span>
      </div>

      <div class="work">
        <a href="#">02. another universe ↗</a>
        <span class="tag">ONESHOT</span>
      </div>

      <div class="work">
        <a href="#">03. somewhere in june ↗</a>
        <span class="tag">THREAD</span>
      </div>

      <div class="work">
        <a href="#">04. almost, maybe ↗</a>
        <span class="tag">SERIES</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="about">
      <h2>♡ ABOUT ME</h2>
      <p class="intro">
        Just another person collecting stories
        and leaving little pieces of imagination
        on the internet.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section id="links">
      <h2>♡ FIND ME ELSEWHERE</h2>
      <p class="intro">
        Twitter / Instagram / CuriousCat
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    © 2026 KURONEKO ARCHIVE — made with ♡
    <br>thanks for visiting!
  </footer>

</div>

</body>
</html>
